WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.878
Model and runtime choices are security and operations decisions, not just engineering preferences.

2
00:00:06.878 --> 00:00:19.994
Model size, model capability, quantization, context window, latency, hardware requirements, memory needs, licensing, and supportability all affect whether a system can be safely operated.

3
00:00:19.994 --> 00:00:24.713
The best model for a workflow is not always the largest or newest model.

4
00:00:24.713 --> 00:00:29.911
It is the model whose capability, cost, control, and reliability fit the job.

5
00:00:29.911 --> 00:00:36.469
A smaller model may be faster, cheaper, easier to isolate, and good enough for a focused workflow.

6
00:00:36.469 --> 00:00:48.146
A larger model may be helpful for complex reasoning or broader language tasks, but it may require more expensive hardware, stricter monitoring, and clearer usage controls.

7
00:00:48.146 --> 00:00:57.983
Quantization and runtime settings can reduce resource demands, but they may also affect output quality, latency, and evaluation requirements.

8
00:00:57.983 --> 00:01:01.102
The runtime determines real system behavior.

9
00:01:01.102 --> 00:01:12.139
It controls how requests are accepted, how sessions are managed, how context is assembled, whether outputs stream, what rate limits apply, and how usage is logged.

10
00:01:12.139 --> 00:01:22.536
Local model runners, inference servers, private endpoints, gateways, and orchestration layers each create different operational responsibilities.

11
00:01:22.536 --> 00:01:25.335
Tool access deserves special attention.

12
00:01:25.335 --> 00:01:33.493
Tools let an AI system search, read, write, call APIs, create tickets, run workflows, or interact with internal systems.

13
00:01:33.493 --> 00:01:40.451
A private model with broad tools can still create serious operational risk if permissions are unclear.

14
00:01:40.451 --> 00:01:49.408
Sovereign AI requires deliberate runtime decisions, scoped tools, monitored usage, and approval patterns for sensitive actions.

15
00:01:49.408 --> 00:01:54.607
Downloading a model is not the same thing as designing a controlled AI system.
